  "_comment": "Known-deprecated / superseded npm packages -> recommended successor. The npm registry's own 'deprecated' field is authoritative and checked first; this list catches packages that are abandoned-in-practice but not formally flagged, plus well-known migrations. Value is the successor. Curated — keep small and high-confidence.",
